        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yusufu na akuluvake",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo nkuhweneha kuikala nchilambo cha ku Kanaani, chilambo chachiikala atatake muchi mmidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aino njo histoliya ya Yakobo na vanu va nnukolo lwake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yusufu mwana wanga Yakobo panavele na vyaka kumi na saba, nang'e ávachunga angandolo na ambudi chalumo na akuluvake va ayuvake vanji. Anevo akuluvake nni vana va atatake vavavelekedîle kwa avala ajavake vatumwa, yani Biliha na Zilipa. Na Yusufu nkuva wannyaulila atatake habali dikee dyambone kwamba anevo akuluvake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi Isilaeli, yani Yakobo nkuntamwa namene Yusufu kupunda vana vake vanji vammalele ing'anya ávele mwana wanammeleke muusele wake. Yakobo nkulaija vantotele Yusufu lijoho likatapele namene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henga avala akuluvake pavawene kuva atatawao àntamwa namene Yusufu kupunda vavana vanji vammalele, vanang'o nkunsunalila Yusufu na nanga pavanalonjedile nawe kwa amani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Indoto yanga Yusufu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Liduva limo Yusufu nkulota indoto. Nang'e nkuvahaulila akuluvake kwamba aneyo indoto, vanang'o nkuhalija kunsunalila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yusufu ávahaulidile kuchidoni, “Pilikanila indoto ingulotile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngúlotile tuvammalele tuvèlè kumawelu utuhunganga visa vya ngano. Upala chisa changu nkuimila, na visa vyenu nkuchidinguka chisa changu na kuchihunamila mpaka pahi kwa eshima.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akuluvake nkummuja kuchidoni, “Dachi, wako ùlembela ututawale hwetu? Dachi, muhiu kuva wako uchiututawale hwetu?” Bahi vanang'o nkuhalija kunsunalila ing'anya ya indoto na malove lake lavahaulidile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi Yusufu nkulota kavila indoto inji, nkuvasimulila akuluvake wachidoni, “Mwenu pilikanila! Ngùlotile indoto inji. Muindoto aneyo ngúliwene liduva na mwedi na dinondwa kumi na moja udinguhunamila mpaka pahi kwa eshima.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na pachivasimulila akuluvake indoto aneyo, atatake nanang'e ánipwawa. Henga atatake nkunkalipila wachidoni, “Indoto ntwani aneyo yulotile? Ìmbehululika dachi nangu na anyoko na akuluvako tukuhunamile wako mpaka pahi kwa eshima?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akuluvake nkummikila wiu, henga atatake nkulavika munda malove anelo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kusumiswa kwanga Yusufu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi liduva limo akuluvake Yusufu vápite unavachunga anyama va atatawao pepi na ku Shekemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isilaeli nkunnyaulila Yusufu kuchidoni, “Akuluvako vàvachunga anyama aneko ku Shekemu. Bahi nangu ngùlembela nikutume ukavalole.” Yusufu nkuyang'ula kuchidoni, “Nangu ngùvele chihi tayali.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atatake nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Hwena ukavalole akuluvako na anyama kama vàvele salama, koka uuye unguhaulile.” Bahi Yakobo nkuntuma Yusufu kuuka anepo paluhunde lwa Hebloni, pachinu pavachiikala, ahwene ku Shekemu. Yusufu panavele pepi kuhwika ku Shekemu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wanachidumba-dumba mwilanga, nkukojana na munu yumo. Aneyo munu nkummuja Yusufu kuchidoni, “Utaha chamani?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yusufu nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Ngùvataha akuluvangu. Chonde nguhaulile pachinu pavavachungila anyama.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayula munu nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Anevo vanu apano vàniuka, kwa kuva nívapilikene uvahaula kuva vàhwena ku Dosani.” Bahi Yusufu nkuvalondola akuluvake, nkuvakoja aneko ku Dosani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi akuluvake pavammwene avèlè kwa kulehu, kabla akànambihwika, vanang'o nkutenda ntemelo wa kummwalala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkuhaulanila kuchidoni, “Lola, nkúlota àvenkwida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi tummwalale na kuntaya nchihima chimo muavi, koka tukahaule kuva àliwije na nnyama wa kuyoha wa munnyitu, koka tulole anedyo dindoto dyake dìmbekuva dachi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henga Lubeni papilikene anelo malove, nkulembela ampohe mmakono mwavo wachidoni, “Chonde, tunammwalale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ing'anya ntwani tumwadile myadi kwa makono letu? Tuntaye chihi nchihima achino cha apano palilanga koka tunneke ahwe chihi mwene.” Lubeni áhawile uchocho uchinga ampohe Yusufu mmakono mwavo, koka ammuihe kukaya kwa atatake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yusufu pahwikile kwa akuluvake, vanang'o nkunkudumbula alila lijoho likatapêle lyanawete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi nkunkamula na kuntaya nchihima chikavele na medi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akuluvake Yusufu pavachilya chakulya, nkuvona Vaisumaili vavêle mmwanda uvahaloka ku Gileadi uvahwena ku Misili. Na angamila vao ványakuhijwe misigo ya samani ing'ulu, yani ubani na manemane na aina dinji dya ulimbo wa kunung'ila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anepo Yuda nkuvahaulila anung'unuvake kuchidoni, “Tùmbepata chamani tukàmmwalala nnung'unwetu na kupiha chitendo anecho? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa kuva, ayu ni nnung'unwetu, na nni myadi imo na hwetu, bahi tunammwalale, wasa tunsumise chihi kwa ava Vaisumaili.” Bahi akuluvake na anung'unuvake nkukubali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi Vaisumaili,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37:28",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Apano pàlembwije Vamidiani. Vaisumaili njo Vamidiani.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " yani vakúchuusa va Chimidiani pavakamwele pachinu apala, akuluvake Yusufu nkunhumya Yusufu nchihima, nkunsumisa kwa vipande ishilini vya madini la dihela. Na anevo vakúchuusa nkunnyakula Yusufu mpaka ku Misili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi Lubeni pauyite apala pachihima, nanga panammwene kavila Yusufu, nang'e nkupapula dinguwo dyake, ing'anya ánihinginika namene, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nkuvahwenela anung'unuvake nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Nnung'unwetu akapali nchihima! Vino nangu nìmbetenda dachi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi vanang'o nkunsinja umbudi, nkulitwala alila lijoho lyanga Yusufu, nkulichuvika mmyadi ya umbudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkulitwala alila lijoho nkumpelekejija atatawao, nkunnyaulila kuchidoni, “Alino lijoho tùnililakota. Lilole ikàva lya mwanalo au nanga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atatawao palilolite nkulimala, nkuchidoni, “Alino lijoho lya mwanangu! Muhiu nnyama wa kuyoha àninkamula na kuntang'una. Muhiu Yusufu ànihalangwa vipande-vipande.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi Yakobo nkupapulanga dinguwo dyake ing'anya ánihinginika namene, nkuwala inguwo ya ligunila nchikundu, nkunkutangila mwanawe kwa maduva lohe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vana vake vachilume na vachimahe nkwida unantuja ntima, henga nang'e nkuhita kutujwa ntima wachidoni, “Ngulekange. Nangu nguchinguhwenehe kunkutangila mwanangu mpaka panimbekuhwa.” Bahi atatake nkuhweneha kunkutangila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
